Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:01:56.51,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\c&HB0ACDA&\3c&HE8E2DA&\b1\fs19}Watch Out for {\c&HCAECF4&\3c&HABAEAF&}Fall Mold\N\N{\c&H2F2F34&\3c&HF5F5F5&\fs16}We're seeing a lot of\N{\3c&HC8B87D&\c&HF5F5F5&}mold damage {\c&H2F2F34&\3c&HF5F5F5&}due to\Nthe lack of sunny\Ndays this year!\N\N{\c&HB5AA98&\3c&HE2E7D7&}Mold starts to grow\Nwhen the temperature\Nis between 20-30°C\Nand humidity is around 70%.\N\N{\u1}We recommend leaving\Nyour closet doors open{\u0}\Nbefore you go out!!\N\N{\c&H5E5D52&\3c&HCFCFA2&}We are happy to clean\Nyour moldy clothes\Nfor you here.
