Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.27,0:02:11.03,sign_3076_9_The_resort_s_lar,text,0,0,0,,The resort's large seaside pool is only open in the summer and\Nallows you to enjoy a spectacular view of the ocean while you relax!\NWhile Hatsushima has no sandy beaches, the pool is fun for\Nthe family and a safe way to swim while taking in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.27,0:02:11.03,sign_3076_10_The_pool_actuall,text,0,0,0,,The pool actually uses seawater.
