Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:25.04,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,The rain is getting heavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:30.67,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,The news did say that it will get \Neven worse this evening and overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:34.56,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Maybe I should give up \Non visiting the bath today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:38.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\fnArial\frz21.61\fs19\pos(209,51)\c&H606369&\3c&HF5F7F7&}Store Receipt
