Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:38.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs16\c&H5B5F64&\3c&HF3F5F6&\frz23.01\pos(192,255)}Ready on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:38.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs14\c&H093A4F&\3c&H5EB2E5&\frz23.72\b1\pos(443,282)}Kinme
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.17,0:02:41.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,He still hasn't come to pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:43.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And there's only two days \Nleft of summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:47.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It probably just slipped his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:08.83,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You two are absolutely soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:12.52,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kinme-san. \NIs it okay if we take cover in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:14.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course! Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:23.03,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,So like, we were doing homework \Nat the library and when we left,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:25.46,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,it totally started pouring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:28.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You probably shouldn't be \Nout and about today anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:35.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm working on a stain right now, \Nso I'd better get back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:38.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Feel free to stay a while and dry off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:39.11,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:40.87,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:43.85,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Kinme-san always seems so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.87,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HF6F7F9&\frz18.18\fscx46\fscy44\pos(161.5,114)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.87,sign_3076_10_The_pool_actuall,text,0,0,0,,{\fs8\frz18.73\pos(116,128)}The resort's large\Nseaside pool is only open in the\Nsummer and allows you to\Nenjoy a spectacular view of\Nthe ocean while you relax!\N\NWhile Hatsushima has no\Nsandy beaches, the pool is\Nfun for the family and a\Nsafe way to swim while taking\Nin the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.87,sign_3076_10_The_pool_actuall,text,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(1,99)\frz18.47}The pool actually uses seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:50.43,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Whoa! What the heck? It's Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:54.76,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh, Hatsushima? \NI'm so jealous! Did you go for fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:58.89,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Man, this takes me back. We went there \Nfor an elementary school field trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.89,0:04:00.22,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.22,0:04:04.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, I didn't exactly go for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:09.24,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,During our field trip there, \Nwhen we were all fishing on the seawall...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:23.02,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Kyu-kun caught a stingray \Nand everyone went nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:20.37,Flashback,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.37,0:04:21.23,Flashback,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's a stingray!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:22.20,Flashback,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}A stingray!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:24.33,Flashback,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yay! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:27.79,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Moruda decided to try \Nto mess with it and, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:30.91,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,he almost got stung!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:35.07,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember that. Stingray tails \Nhave those nasty venomous barbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.05,0:04:39.08,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh, what a fun memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:43.15,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. So was this your first trip \Nto Hatsushima, Kinme-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:45.31,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:47.06,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Hmm? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:49.81,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Thanks for the towel, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:50.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:54.06,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,The rain lightened up some, \Nso I'd better run home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:56.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh? There's really no need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:01.76,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Actually, it's my turn \Nto cook dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.17,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,You can stay longer if you want, Kyu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:06.37,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,M'kay, see you next term!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:08.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:11.94,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Well, I should probably get going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:14.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute, Kyusho-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:16.64,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll get your bag for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:20.51,Default,Kyu-kun,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. \NI totally forgot about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:23.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I thought so. Wait right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:26.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I should be done with the stain soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:30.93,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,So she does have a good memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:40.82,sign_3076_10_The_pool_actuall,text,0,0,0,,{\frz345.5\an8\pos(355,40)}The pool actually\Nuses seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:57.60,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Power's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:06.20,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Wait, weren't you just \Nrunning the washer and dryer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:09.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, they both stopped mid-course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:10.36,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:13.48,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do? \NIsn't that bad for the clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.33,0:06:17.73,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm not going to do a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.08,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:21.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,In a situation like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:26.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,panicking and pulling out everything \Nbeing washed and dried
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,would probably be riskier for the clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:33.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll wait and see, and once the power is \Nback, maybe just start everything over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:35.88,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:40.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But the question is, how long is \Nthe power going to stay out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:44.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It would be great if it came back \Nbefore I have to close shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:50.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! I was going to give you \Nyour bag. I'll go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.82,0:06:57.78,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:05.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,P-Please take good care of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:07.28,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, here. I should lend you an umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:12.42,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:13.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:16.67,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll stay a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:17.48,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:21.67,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, you don't \Nseem to like it much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:22.84,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.31,0:07:30.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me at all! \NI-If it doesn't last... very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.39,0:07:33.14,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Yeah. Bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:37.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,B-But it isn't as scary \Nas ghosts, at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:39.80,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Huh? She's scared of ghosts too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:45.31,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,The rain's getting heavier again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:53.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Th-Then maybe you should\N stay a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:04.17,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\c&H21221F&\3c&H606766&\fs26\pos(329,201)\fad(1103,1)}We are closed for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:07.93,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm. Power still isn't back yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.93,0:08:10.39,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and it's already starting to get dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:16.68,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\frz13.02\fs18\pos(187,24)\shad0\c&HE7E9E3&\3c&H675B3A&}Message
