Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:15.67,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HA7F9FF&\frz13.05\fscx38\fscy13\pos(288.5,106)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.93,0:08:15.67,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs18\shad0\c&H8B9299&\3c&HA7F9FF&\an7\frz12.25\bord2\pos(250,110)}It's already\Nback here
