Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.93,0:08:15.67,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\c&H8B9299&\3c&HEEF8FA&\an7\frz12.25\bord2\pos(322,192)}Do you need me home soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:15.19,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sounds like this is the only area \Nwhere power is still out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:16.68,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEEF8FA&\frz13.05\fscx38\fscy13\pos(352.5,-5)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
