Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:19.74,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Looks like Mom can handle \Nthe inn by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:20.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,She can?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:24.29,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's close!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:34.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? What? What is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:39.44,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,That lightning strike might have \Nknocked something over in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:40.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:45.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll go check the back entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:46.24,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:18.45,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Thanks for lending me something to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:19.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:23.71,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Those are the only things \NI had here in your size.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.71,0:10:27.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I bought that track jacket \Nto practice cleaning stains on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:30.15,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,This is totally fine with me. \NThanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:34.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can't offer much, but why \Ndon't you eat before you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.03,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:37.86,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I really don't want to impose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:40.08,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, it's no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:44.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Think of it as thanks for putting \Nthe washing machine back upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:52.92,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(421,245)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:57.93,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(78,25)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:08.31,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I really do appreciate the help. \NThank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:12.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There's nothing I could've \Ndone about it by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:13.82,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:29.13,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yum! This dried fish...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:31.96,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,It tastes the same as the fish \Nwe serve guests at the inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, isn't it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:36.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HCEC0B7&\3c&H9A501C&\shad0\fad(315,1)\move(456,47,437,47,148,2150)}Gift Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:36.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HDCCCC2&\3c&H9A501C&\fs17\shad0\fad(315,1)\move(214,90,195,90,23,2150)}Atsuei Dried Fish Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:36.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's from that store by the beach,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,the Atsuei Dried Fish Shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.88,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,The Atsuei Dried Fish Shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.67,0:11:44.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The first time I tasted it, \NI was so impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.35,Flashback,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Here you go, honey. Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:50.35,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,What? But I'm still \Non the clock right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:55.68,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:00.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:20.56,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,She wears glasses.
