Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.78,0:12:39.53,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs13\shad0\c&H8B9299&\3c&HA7F9FF&\an7\bord2\frz10.28\pos(300,312)}I'll call
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.23,0:12:38.86,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Huh? Call?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:43.68,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.25,0:12:45.12,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:47.54,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:49.36,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,And over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:51.46,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Well, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:54.48,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh? You want me to put Kinme-san on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:57.92,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Mom says she wants to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:12:59.93,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? To me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:04.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello, Ishimochi-san? Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:08.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh... No, it's no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:12.71,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, not at all. In fact, \NI should be the one apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.71,0:13:14.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.26,0:13:17.69,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry about this, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:22.20,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,I can drive over and pick Kyu up. \NIt'll probably be pretty late, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:24.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous, Ishimochi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:27.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You shouldn't go outside,\Neven if it is in a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:31.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The rain and winds are too strong, \Nand we have no idea when it will stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.65,0:13:35.96,Italics,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,I know, but I've got to \Npick him up sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:39.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well then, maybe I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:42.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,have Kyusho-kun spend the night here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:43.16,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:46.64,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, it's perfectly fine! \NPlease don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:48.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,All right. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.98,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Uh, I really shouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:54.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's fine! Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:55.55,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:02.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's really okay! No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:05.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll set it up so we can sleep \Nin separate rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:08.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The second floor storage room \Nis empty right now, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:10.54,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:13.75,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,But you've already done so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:20.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I've got everything covered. Let's just \Nsay the feeling is mutual, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.37,0:14:24.02,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I can't depend on Kyusho-kun all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:26.13,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I gotta show him I'm dependable too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.89,0:14:28.01,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:40.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But I wonder why the power \Nhasn't come back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.15,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:47.99,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I don't feel great about leaving \Nthat unfinished laundry overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:51.66,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,What should I do? Hand wash it after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:14:59.80,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's finally back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:03.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.01,0:15:03.67,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:07.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I have to \Nget back to work right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:08.81,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:11.81,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Feel free to relax \Nand make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:18.43,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,There she goes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:38.82,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\pos(321,128)\fs30}Start
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:38.69,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\fs30\pos(323,263)}Pause
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:20.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,These go here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:24.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and these here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:28.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.70,0:16:31.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I think we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:33.84,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:36.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:38.05,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.48,0:16:48.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,We should be able to use the shower now,\N so why don't you go on in first?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:51.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That'll give me a chance \Nto get your futon ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.29,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Oh. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:17:01.16,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I'll have to check out \Nthe backyard tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:09.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:19.76,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,That tree went straight through \Nthe roof over the porch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:24.52,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Um, I'm out, so go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.57,0:17:26.57,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Kinme-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:28.72,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:31.05,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:34.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:38.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, would you mind if we slept\N in the same room tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:40.53,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,But what about the other room?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.53,0:17:45.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, since I got to finish washing, \NI'm using it to dry clothes right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:49.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm really so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:52.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you don't want to, \NI can sleep in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.56,0:17:55.30,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,No, I can't... make you do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:18:00.18,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,But I mean, if it doesn't \Nbother you, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:03.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:04.69,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.97,0:18:08.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Then I'll go take a bath too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:32.50,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Actually, last time I was in this room...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.47,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,was the day that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:53.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Did I wake you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:58.38,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,No, it's okay. I was still awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.09,0:19:10.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:13.00,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:26.35,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There's still some rumbling\N in the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:28.20,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sounds like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:34.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But if it's that far away, \NI won't get scared, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:39.71,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Just now in the bath,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:44.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I started wondering about what could \Nhave caused me to be so afraid of thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:48.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I wonder what started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:20:01.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Actually, I don't really know if \NI've ever been to Hatsushima before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:08.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,{\t(5963,6255,\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}The person I went with said it looked\N like I was lost in my memories there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:17.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sometimes even recent memories, \Nmemories from the last two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:19.45,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,just up and disappear on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.95,0:20:25.53,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's almost like somebody who isn't me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:29.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,is doing things I'm not aware of \Nwhen I'm not looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:36.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But I don't think there's anything \NI can do about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:45.22,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, if you ever forgot \Nabout me and Kuriru and Moruda,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.23,0:20:47.64,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I think I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.38,0:21:35.52,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Thank you! I know this was asking a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:41.03,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, it was fine! He even helped me out \Na bunch around the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:43.53,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kyu was helpful for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.53,0:21:45.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, he sure was!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:48.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun, thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.17,0:21:56.92,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Well dang, Kyu! Nice job. Good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.43,0:21:58.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:22:01.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun! Your bag, your bag!
